# ── Android signing material — NEVER commit ──────────────────────────────────
# The TWA keystore signs releases as Frenzsave. Anyone holding it can publish an
# app that Android trusts as ours, and Play will reject a future update signed
# with a different key — so it is both a security risk and unrecoverable if lost.
# Kept outside the repo entirely (see docs/ANDROID_APP.md); these patterns exist
# so an accidental copy into the working tree can never be staged.
*.keystore
*.jks
signing-key-info.txt
*Google Play package*.zip
*.aab
